  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A proton enters an area of perpendicularly oriented electric and magnetic fields with a horizontal velocity of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. Magnetic field <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B\"></span> is pointing into the page and electric field <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span> is pointing vertically upwards. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the magnitude of the resultant force on the proton?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">zero</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"evB\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"e(vB - E)\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"e(vB + E)\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
